he assassin she loves to protect their future when an old enemy resurfaces.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9476,\"title\":\"A Knight's Tale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/srb1XnrlDZHcdpjBKqUu4qAzxKU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gkT737kgnmI6jZyXbUBJRwVbGkW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"William Thatcher, a knight's peasant apprentice, gets a chance at glory when the knight dies suddenly mid-tournament. Posing as a knight himself, William won't stop until he's crowned tournament champion—assuming matters of the heart don't get in the way.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":369885,\"title\":\"Allied\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sV4lXM32quwminL3TP36nlNPp7Q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cdR0qwyaMfuZRfTYEixUmRnmdop.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1942, an intelligence officer in North Africa encounters a female French Resistance fighter on a deadly mission behind enemy lines. When they reunite in London, their relationship is tested by the pressures of war.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":445651,\"title\":\"The Darkest Minds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8NdQneXBYVbBKt81bFhXiyThe0h.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5BxrMNGl3YDiWgHCVJu8iLQoJDM.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a disease kills 98% of America's children, the surviving 2% develop superpowers and are placed in internment camps. A 16-year-old girl escapes her camp and joins a group of other teens on the run from the government.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":672322,\"title\":\"Rurouni Kenshin: The Beginning\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rODS466qSdrwMlGdbUwPENhDN2c.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iGmfHHa3CSqKrH3yeS9CQVLAVUl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Before he was a protector, Kenshin was a fearsome assassin known as Battosai. But when he meets gentle Tomoe Yukishiro, a beautiful young woman who carries a huge burden in her heart, his life will change forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2008,\"title\":\"The Promise\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tdm4mlc27S1d72ub4Y4xcU2OlDD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AwlJ2bQGjfEuXLsL5XJAaxOmMuV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An orphaned girl, driven by poverty at such a young age, makes a promise with an enchantress. In return for beauty and the admiration of every man, she will never be with the man she loves. This spell cannot be broken unless the impossible happens: snow falling in spring and the dead coming back to life. Now a grown and beautiful princess, she regrets her promise, for all of the men she's loved has always been met with tragedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44918,\"title\":\"Titanic II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3m12UeP1DMfhYZyvpLftaJGsyp3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9XRikkyth0GtG8RkU3XNm0oMsA.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the 100th anniversary of the original voyage, a modern luxury liner christened \\\"Titanic 2,\\\" follows the path of its namesake. But when a tsunami hurls an ice berg into the new ship's path, the passengers and crew must fight to avoid a similar fate.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9833,\"title\":\"The Phantom of the Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTsp2VTaCBiGs8w05OTXfD97FRZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p3P0eTh8AnqauhRZg0wgoBFvcjF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The deformed Phantom who haunts the Paris Opera House causes murder and mayhem in an attempt to make the woman he loves a star.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":156,\"title\":\"Wilbur Wants to Kill Himself\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bRrHJbr8kMb849IKBZ0RBk2Vmte.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2bCcbNyB1g5F8CXqABo0JsNig73.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The strange comedy film of two close brothers; one, Wilbur, who wants to kill himself, and the other, Harbour, who tries to prevent this. When their father dies leaving them his bookstore they meet a woman who makes their lives a bit better yet with a bit more trouble as well.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270374,\"title\":\"Sugar Orange\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wg26a1IiZasz5hFJNvRnEdmbpKJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/obsurAm0oiAVIUBY1PgxV4wUiao.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lukas is Sugar, Clemens is Orange. Together, they are two ten-year-old boys who are inseparable. More than just playmates, they share a unique bond which seems predestined to last a lifetime. Until, that is, powerful emotions come to the fore and a misunderstanding leads to a rift which tears both them and their world apart. Twenty years later, Lukas is still terrified of being abandoned. He survives by forming loose relationships which don't threaten him. Then one day he meets Lena who turns his feelings upside down and awakens his inner child, the one still searching for unconditional friendship. While there is never a guarantee of security, there is a bond of trust, and through Lena, Lukas again makes contact with Clemens. After years of silence, they are finally able to exorcise their ghosts in an explosion of emotion.\",\"genr